.\n\nRenames misleading uses of collection_usage_key to collection_locator, including in the content_libraries.api and content.search.api method names and parameters.\n\nThis change impacts Developers, but should not affect end users.\n\nThis refactoring seems reasonable to do without going through deprecation, given the minimal use of these APIs.\n\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJn+TOWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtC0QAEShMIHqIE4CjeeZOcCKFZ/6\nEIfUoSLRyoFZokb9WlQMvvlzhjxqj+tMNqGMNOazZX8oE7ZzQej8MueO6DLaaV3x\n+EXsDzZgAwpIp1YBFGUoK79CaakeDCVbwC29DhEKKhfo/Urp82P1d6VRLfUQ8JbN\nMkSX+ONKhSOhUiDLldGoJIIOJ17cZtkNgJ5qxbTlqzCxw1Gs5DmxqljXOkngHkKY\nbUhRsF/QOldv6GeIqFr8VdTSdFsEVIIuUz9pyEHs3fC2E/TWrZ4HD2ky/juAhb7J\nhMxStMmUXhIjqCxBX39G3s7MSqmayU48HkCeBCDXsxGUf3Zt+amWmeQJ/11eZhtg\nFb8VGGMoHpqzLAzPgdQNmWhu5/h8rCfeHaQF+8Yqe+8mkGwTwPowRRP8zGfc5lOQ\nMRSxCvaNJEGdjLm038lH6HM8CqsXsKrWth7upAejSbeefgHFuaLAJTCOApVJREhr\nD/0VuQtX1uT11YRq8oRhMC/hdmwwU+slfIZgCkQU9HCtG5XMShZZ2VzeTtdPClZT\nPZ2bohx3yqK5WhT6pEogzoH9rNgc5YccPsF9tGuS4Pgt32hDB0Dz93jgUwF74zVo\nHIlR94mJCviFrLa2qp1FZkYmIppIWXF0iXc8Z6QZ7ZRauUmq31YAdiubYy/1Nn3z\nH1GrQGqPCevDpXqYDOWr\n=6zPX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-04-13T20:44:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github