{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/irtazaakram/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/irtazaakram","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abrhamg/open_edx/commits/de75c37047a782ad1b3979ead54e3b34623d043e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-04-10T15:01:38Z","email":"51848298+irtazaakram@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Irtaza Akram"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-04-10T15:01:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: duplicate rendering of instructions in annotatable xblock (#36445)\n\nIn the Annotatable XBlock, the <instructions> element was appearing\ntwice in the student view:\n\n* Once in \"annotatable-instructions\" (where it should be).\n* Again in \"annotatable-content\" (where annotations and other content are rendered).\n\nThe _render_content method processed and rendered the entire XML\ndata, including <instructions>, without removing it. The\n_extract_instructions method, which is responsible for removing\n<instructions>, was not called in _render_content, leading to\nduplication.\n\nThis fix will:\n\n* Prevents duplicate instructions in the student view.\n* Maintains the expected behavior of showing instructions only in\n  \"annotatable-instructions\".\n* No impact on existing annotation functionality.","tree":{"sha":"3cef3f4638674566dcdf870162db2dcd19053fa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abrhamg/open_edx/git/trees/3cef3f4638674566dcdf870162db2dcd19053fa8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abrhamg/open_edx/git/commits/de75c37047a782ad1b3979ead54e3b34623d043e","verification":{"payload":"tree 3cef3f4638674566dcdf870162db2dcd19053fa8\nparent b9556211be9975d396530cea214326e2a918804a\nauthor Irtaza Akram <51848298+irtazaakram@users.noreply.github.com> 1744297298 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1744297298 -0400\n\nfix: duplicate rendering of instructions in annotatable xblock (#36445)\n\nIn the Annotatable XBlock, the <instructions> element was appearing\ntwice in the student view:\n\n* Once in \"annotatable-instructions\" (where it should be).\n* Again in \"annotatable-content\" (where annotations and other content are rendered).\n\nThe _render_content method processed and rendered the entire XML\ndata, including <instructions>, without removing it. The\n_extract_instructions method, which is responsible for removing\n<instructions>, was not called in _render_content, leading to\nduplication.\n\nThis fix will:\n\n* Prevents duplicate instructions in the student view.\n* Maintains the expected behavior of showing instructions only in\n  \"annotatable-instructions\".\n* No impact on existing annotation functionality.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJn991SCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATbkQAITkvCtWegjlJl09Jgsch94a\n25+rO8VduLGxvxavK8Bg8+YDS1W5Dya8O4qnlV+KPI9Q1Up3jQzjnIeus1gc9onU\nT4KJ50795Sca+c+dTtJXVl6TPMxbycP9AW3zZ5+bM0TDmAlXAqUFpfWMErlwduVb\ndgRdNE9aEDhRhjQuUc/QIY4G0+0IUnNSDC1H6toExIyMbOz9Yd5tak0CPNes1AA7\npXrgNTsqmB4N4MDZBOs1/ZOE1wwmPaMf3K3SUVgf24gxgx7xKrj75jdDWdI95TYY\nLrds9wIFqHI35BYEd+Fc1ysIVkN0cDbIzjzjVr4gJQaBBQM1xph6ex6CR9MlZ5SI\nW0BfcYpqwy0h6s8MOQI6KZZK0UubUA6jEc2kA6UktzPN5kyP9iP2An3G+6jRK/XY\nq6gkfbaNuTwza8E7whPwemwKFXcl5LqIpLmHwLw8HW2YJFjVqTvkN1Swf8mokrRJ\nr/v+XVBW9UTGo81KF/FtpHtukisQ4qSagHhWb3qehJl2R7+2jJP4XMS59kMP2pbb\nJ/4Hhr5+tbLzpFOWaxE/yk7tNoa2l+eJ92Ip9s1dKnn0VJ4WxfCb7L8x2/2mKDy9\nNY+Gl4+3fqY4PSs7OCvzYLfoXwGu3YKX9MBjLZS/oCpASgOQs6t+1ciEnk3LazY8\nOO6pgwV1JOCn49dddCyQ\n=cv8k\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-04-13T20:44:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","grav