1c123f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-04-09T18:10:12Z","email":"kyle@axim.org","name":"Kyle McCormick"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-04-09T18:10:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Globally Enable Studio Content REST API (#36488)\n\nThere was a waffle flag `contentstore.enable_studio_content_api`,\nintended to gate the \"experimental\" REST APIs at\n`<CMS_ROOT>/api/contentstore/v{0,1,2}/*`. In practice, these APIs are no\nlonger experimental: for the past few named releases, they have been\nenabled in Tutor and used to power the Authoring MFE.\n\nWe are making the Authoring MFE default-on in all Open edX sites\nstarting in Teak, with the legacy authoring frontend slated for removal\nby Ulmo. Therefore, we need to remove flag which is gating the REST API.\nWe are _not_ introducing a temporary opt-out toggle, as we do need feel\nit is necessary.\n\nPart of: https://github.com/openedx/edx-platform/issues/36275","tree":{"sha":"b4834bf2d7f9518fd95833ac146a95039fbd9af7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abrhamg/open_edx/git/trees/b4834bf2d7f9518fd95833ac146a95039fbd9af7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abrhamg/open_edx/git/commits/1e6b40ac9a22fc3d5c59e4dcb9f46878d21c123f","verification":{"payload":"tree b4834bf2d7f9518fd95833ac146a95039fbd9af7\nparent e6c24bdd0d178b05a583875615591d171db2f4e9\nauthor Kyle McCormick <kyle@axim.org> 1744222212 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1744222212 -0400\n\nfix: Globally Enable Studio Content REST API (#36488)\n\nThere was a waffle flag `contentstore.enable_studio_content_api`,\nintended to gate the \"experimental\" REST APIs at\n`<CMS_ROOT>/api/contentstore/v{0,1,2}/*`. In practice, these APIs are no\nlonger experimental: for the past few named releases, they have been\nenabled in Tutor and used to power the Authoring MFE.\n\nWe are making the Authoring MFE default-on in all Open edX sites\nstarting in Teak, with the legacy authoring frontend slated for remova