cies\n- README.md: Update project documentation\n- .replit: Updated app configuration\n\n---\n\nUser prompt:\n\nProject Objective\nI want to build a read-only dashboard (initially) to display all JIRA tickets in a project, categorized by engineer, and showing progress status. Future enhancement will include a form to report new issues directly to JIRA.\n\nPhase 1 – One-Page JIRA Ticket Dashboard\n🎯 Goals:\nFetch and display tickets from a JIRA project.\nShow which engineer is working on what.\nShow ticket details (summary, status, priority, etc.).\nMake it viewable only to people within your org (authentication).\n\nIn future phases, i would like to add functionality like create a ticket which will create a ticket on Jira.\n\nI want to build the project with python (fast API) for backend and use React (Ant design) for frontend\nCan you help me setup the project structure with necessary dependencies?\n\nDont write any other code. Wait for my instruction\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Assistant\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: 6cfb2f94-0fa4-4314-8d08-aa8cad9a0e4d","tree":{"sha":"e9126c45f4e20b309e08db9aa44ee3dace95f1ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codesab/work-viewer/git/trees/e9126c45f4e20b309e08db9aa44ee3dace95f1ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codesab/work-viewer/git/commits/e65da81d1b0aafba83f119f42215747489c71bf8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22222016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codesab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codesab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codesab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codesab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codesab","id":22222016,"login":"codesab","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjIyMDE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codesab/orgs","rece