","name":"Sergio Camacho"},"message":"Eliminar estilos CSS obsoletos y refactorizar\n\nEliminar estilos CSS obsoletos y refactorizar el componente SidebarMenu. Se integra Material-UI para mejorar la interfaz del menú lateral, añadiendo un AppBar y un Drawer. Se actualiza la página de Dashboard para utilizar el nuevo SidebarMenu y se mejora la página de seguimiento de órdenes con un diseño más limpio y funcional. Además, se optimiza la página de historial de envíos con una tabla de Material-UI.","tree":{"sha":"7fbab72ac8fc50193716e85dc269444fe6703c19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SergioCamacho88/coordinadora_fronted/git/trees/7fbab72ac8fc50193716e85dc269444fe6703c19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SergioCamacho88/coordinadora_fronted/git/commits/8ce9c04c4b348ecc8bbc692a29a2f8bb6e7edd6e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111036408?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SergioCamacho88","id":111036408,"login":"SergioCamacho88","node_id":"U_kgDOBp5H-A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SergioCamacho88/coordinadora_