io Camacho"},"message":"Actualizar dependencias y mejorar la estructura\n\nSe añaden nuevas dependencias de Material-UI y Emotion para mejorar el diseño de la interfaz. Se actualizan las versiones de React y ReactDOM. Se refactorizan las páginas de Login y Register para utilizar componentes de Material-UI, mejorando la experiencia de usuario. Además, se implementa un tema global utilizando ThemeProvider. Se realizan ajustes en los estilos CSS para asegurar una mejor presentación en la aplicación.","tree":{"sha":"274b4bf3041c94aab64b122318a9a6dd2baa993b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SergioCamacho88/coordinadora_fronted/git/trees/274b4bf3041c94aab64b122318a9a6dd2baa993b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SergioCamacho88/coordinadora_fronted/git/commits/27eae0f0b8d4da0979053a9351d9979258ed89a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111036408?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SergioCamacho88","id":111036408,"login":"SergioCamacho88","node_id":"U_kgDOBp5H-A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SergioCamacho88/coordinado