ergio Camacho"},"message":"Agregar menú lateral\n\nSe implementa el componente SidebarMenu que muestra opciones de navegación basadas en el rol del usuario (admin o usuario). Además, se crea el MainLayout que integra el SidebarMenu y permite renderizar las rutas hijas. Se elimina la página de asignación de órdenes y se actualizan las rutas en el enrutador para reflejar los cambios. Se añade la página de bienvenida y se implementa el historial de envíos para los usuarios.","tree":{"sha":"6a6c1a2fb5900cdd11b7f3182c8987b08459b35e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SergioCamacho88/coordinadora_fronted/git/trees/6a6c1a2fb5900cdd11b7f3182c8987b08459b35e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SergioCamacho88/coordinadora_fronted/git/commits/17b630f7e672ee8bd6d22a276cd692cf6ecc45ba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111036408?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SergioCamacho88","id":111036408,"login":"SergioCamacho88","node_id":"U_kgDOBp5H-A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SergioCamacho88","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SergioCamacho88/coordinadora_fronted/commit/17b630f7