"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/customgpt-ai/commits/0ff123433185e6d922c3691486d662a7dd6b6d82/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:47:25Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:47:25Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: remove duplicate EventHandler registration, surface async errors, harden HTTP clients\n\n- [HIGH] Remove inline EventHandler registration from activate(); keep only\n  registerEventHandler() called from start() to prevent every config event\n  being processed twice (double reindex).\n- [HIGH] produceAsynchronousOperations: attach .whenCompleteAsync() to the\n  discarded CompletableFuture.allOf() so task exceptions are logged instead\n  of silently swallowed.\n- [MEDIUM] jahiaClient builder: add .followRedirects(false).followSslRedirects(false)\n  so the Jahia session cookie is never forwarded to redirect destinations.\n- [MEDIUM] initialized field: make volatile for safe cross-thread visibility.\n- [MEDIUM] CustomGptIndexerNodeHandler.indexJahiaPage: add null-guard on\n  jahiaResponse.body() before calling .string() to prevent NPE.\n- [MEDIUM] deleteAllPages: create the batch ExecutorService once in purgeAllPages\n  and pass it down, eliminating repeated thread-pool creation per round.\n- [SONAR] Replace deprecated new URL(String) constructor with\n  URI.create(s).toURL() in CustomGptIndexerNodeHandler and Utils (java:S1874).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"bcc0eee22a4d1de97f65299fca42e2944af51c26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/customgpt-ai/git/trees/bcc0eee22a4d1de97f65299fca42e2944af51c26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/customgpt-ai/git/commits/0ff123433185e6d922c3691486d662a7dd6b6d82","verification":{"payload":"tree bcc0eee22a4d1de97f65299fca42e2944af51c26\nparent 21511481a8957cd1b3d81a17c6f9d7a6e526e39d\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780750045 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780750045 +0200\n\nfix: remove duplicate EventHandler registration, surface async errors, harden HTTP clients\n\n- [HIGH] Remove inline EventHandler registration from activate(); keep only\n  registerEventHandler() called from start() to prevent every config event\n  being processed twice (double reindex).\n- [HIGH] produceAsynchronousOperations: attach .whenCompleteAsync() to the\n  discarded CompletableFuture.allOf() so task exceptions are logged instead\n  of silently swallowed.\n- [MEDIUM] jahiaClient builder: add .followRedirects(false).followSslRedirects(false)\n  so the Jahia session cookie is never forwarded to redirect destinations.\n- [MEDIUM] initialized field: make volatile for safe cross-thread visibility.\n- [MEDIUM] CustomGptIndexerNodeHandler.indexJahiaPage: add null-guard on\n  jahiaResponse.body() before calling .string() to prevent NPE.\n- [MEDIUM] deleteAllPages: create the batch ExecutorService once in purgeAllPages\n  and pass it down, eliminating repeated thread-pool creation per round.\n- [SONAR] Replace deprecated new URL(String) constructor with\n  URI.create(s).toURL() in CustomGptIndexerNodeHandler and Utils (java:S1874).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmokFt0ACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3nm9AgAtsCX7cVOG5JuoC1jlDfNMvKtZUggXSJLrHkvusXYl5m5viMrldG4wVXu\nobnHJUuylL78Xh+eutYNIcaVH/32nK4LoA77iQGzgpslYLATKfSy235ap0HsENj5\n2BotuTpk0xX2SLdP4Numuwi+3qz2F9d9FPr6ESOmQ0QOZTwYMPzAknWo7tiON+1a\nfUupVBppzTxX6PcxFmuMOwdcB1Pog8UxF/wbVyEC1TjOg0c20WWU55BYvDI69OjS\nYLT3q6XU/gjlaw9ni7bc1hPBnRCrBfJlCs0o0JHxd+uZ6oDXqZMvVhLb86B2kHkS\nLKVIU/rQPupzvPNfiUYaClxRyHwkOQ==\n=fYq4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verifi