and replace Math.random\n\n- Release bucketLock before sleeping so other threads can refill/acquire\n  (Sonar S2276 BLOCKER: Thread.sleep while holding a lock blocks unrelated callers).\n- Replace Math.random() with ThreadLocalRandom.nextLong() for back-off jitter (Sonar S2140).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"1959cbea049ee94e015e4e2c9bdc9b07ef60dbb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/customgpt-ai/git/trees/1959cbea049ee94e015e4e2c9bdc9b07ef60dbb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/customgpt-ai/git/commits/d7114614bb31a09727d60123f6264d88ac1e969c","verification":{"payload":"tree 1959cbea049ee94e015e4e2c9bdc9b07ef60dbb7\nparent 1edf8a0081f338ce9df08598ae5ae4bb4094a31e\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778915794 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778915794 +0200\n\nfix(rate-limit): move Thread.sleep outside synchronized block and replace Math.random\n\n- Release bucketLock before sleeping so other threads can refill/acquire\n  (Sonar S2276 BLOCKER: Thread.sleep while holding a lock blocks unrelated callers).\n- Replace Math.random() with ThreadLocalRandom.nextLong() for back-off jitter (Sonar S2140).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoIGdIACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3ku4gf+LGKt4h4iAx5tg3CnHPl+/FOtE/QM7LlV768+1b6o769B/YmqcXqNtPst\nPesBWlKN57h8OcIT1+0VFMlDEvGq7N9w1BT6TG/m3QksffhtFjQTxb46jQkhfqjc\nbHoAz0TomMOu1eDbdp0QYpaxLJ3pYe1L76LwT0ZAvZD1RxfHMhRol2BI8L60xIoq\nFdlwcRbu7HoizfozW/Tfw5WoS/Qx/2mYXQrtyCksjgJvQhVHACo04G1Z8zt9HxT9\n4lkxv8/qs/3DXdI77hAupqo4vGUA0keEryybbScPlF/ebwO0mgEUqDguIEv2ew2s\nJxNntmw6LJY0X39SOf9MOSY3hl7k7g==\n=xJ/2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-19T09:44:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/priv