 inputs\nN-02: add required/aria-required + visible asterisk to projectId/token\nN-03: raise danger zone border (#ef9a9a→#c62828) and success alert\nborder (#a5d6a7→#388e3c) to meet 3:1 non-text contrast\nN-05: replace window.confirm() with accessible native <dialog>\n(role=alertdialog, focus trapped via showModal()) for purge action\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"0058dc33ae79f5560d8cc68f5793e39f904fae9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/customgpt-ai/git/trees/0058dc33ae79f5560d8cc68f5793e39f904fae9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/customgpt-ai/git/commits/c45528e8a6af64f1ef17522102d32df80298ee7b","verification":{"payload":"tree 0058dc33ae79f5560d8cc68f5793e39f904fae9a\nparent f34db7ed3631524ab3de942ab061f8c6fa5209bf\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778831017 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778831017 +0200\n\nfix(a11y): resolve WCAG 2.1 AA issues in CustomGptSettings\n\nC-01: replace dynamic role/aria-live mutation with four separate\nalways-in-DOM live regions (fixed role=status and role=alert)\nC-02: remove setSaveStatus(null)/setPurgeStatus(null) calls before\nawait to prevent race condition that drops AT announcements\nC-03: add useEffect to set document.title on SPA mount (SC 2.4.2)\nM-01: raise input border from #ccc (1.60:1) to #767676 (4.54:1)\nM-02: darken hint text from #767676 (3.97:1) to #595959 (7.0:1)\nM-03: darken success alert text from #2e7d32 to #1b5e20 (5.6:1)\nM-04: convert all px font-sizes to rem for browser zoom support\nM-05: remove setTimeout focus calls to sr-only clipped elements\nN-01: add autoComplete=username/current-password to credential inputs\nN-02: add required/aria-required + visible asterisk to projectId/token\nN-03: raise danger zone border (#ef9a9a→#c62828) and success alert\nborder (#a5d6a7→#388e3c) to meet 3:1 non-text contrast\nN-05: replace window.confirm() with accessible native <dialog>\n(role=alertdialog, focus trapped 