SE"},"message":"docs: update README and AGENTS for rate limiting and streaming-batch purge\n\nREADME:\n- Add ''Rate limiting'' feature bullet (token bucket, 429 back-off)\n- Replace ''Batch operations'' bullet with streaming-batch purge description\n- Add rateLimit.requestsPerSecond to configuration table with restart caveat\n\nAGENTS:\n- Technology stack: note RateLimitInterceptor in HTTP client row\n- Service section: document rate-limit lifecycle (init-time only, restart required)\n  and thread-pool cap (min(batchSize, requestsPerSecond))\n- Replace stale ''Pagination (next_page_url)'' example with response shape reference\n- Replace ''Batch concurrent deletion'' example to show capped threadCount\n- Add ''Purge: streaming-batch pattern'' section explaining why next_page_url must\n  not be followed (offset-pagination drift)\n- Pitfall #3: update GqlSettings field count 16 → 17\n- Add pitfall #7: rateLimit.requestsPerSecond requires restart\n- Add pitfall #8: never follow next_page_url in the purge loop\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"d16d9adaed4b41a18384d22837541133cf4aa3b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/customgpt-ai/git/trees/d16d9adaed4b41a18384d22837541133cf4aa3b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/customgpt-ai/git/commits/2826536d6a4eb1d7e2be2495411e61d209dd6024","verification":{"payload":"tree d16d9adaed4b41a18384d22837541133cf4aa3b3\nparent 53abc6407d293a1976d4f258e981d5f9cd4c6a59\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778702442 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778702442 +0200\n\ndocs: update README and AGENTS for rate limiting and streaming-batch purge\n\nREADME:\n- Add ''Rate limiting'' feature bullet (token bucket, 429 back-off)\n- Replace ''Batch operations'' bullet with streaming-batch purge description\n- Add rateLimit.requestsPerSecond to configuration table with restart caveat\n\nAGENTS:\n- Technology stack: note RateLimitInterceptor in HTTP client row\n- Service section: document rate-limit lifecycle (init-time only, restart required)\n  and thread-pool cap (min(batchSize, requestsPerSecond))\n- Replace stale ''Pagination (next_page_url)'' example with response shape reference\n- Replace ''Batch concurrent deletion'' example to show capped threadCount\n- Add ''Purge: streaming-batch pattern'' section explaining why next_page_url must\n  not be followed (offset-pagination drift)\n- Pitfall #3: update GqlSettings field count 16 → 17\n- Add pitfall #7: rateLimit.requestsPerSecond requires restart\n- Add pitfall #8: never follow next_page_url in the purge loop\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoE2GoACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3lbSQgAsJ97+HZUVMhc/cXUSavLzEg0gX//G0Y9CRweVoVGpsxpMgDkcxgVxXUB\nphZnaTD9ZdhJQznuAtW8pXWIkRp1SgDvH+Sog1Q92hYGiqbtu+Xdq6FeBDOTGcfi\nwUCbV6icr1pqGTvf8z+s8XTgTU0iQtYXxwxbUxBOQUBsRE0nPi1WwYTk+U14zjqf\nYSo5kUFgBVX4aMJGXHfB/IQ3pY9goDeEvapImX7OMTUvgxFHyTo7s2n1NT/acc94\nDKUSE01ZBgYPF2y/c+FwWRdLf2pUqd4f+j+N8v6+q8VNyXr+imaiubjWijg/anW/\nI7wYJT9GGB+qb8p8YMEDWTMfn2NynQ==\n=ZtYq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-13T20:37:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/customgpt-ai/commit/2826536d6a4eb1d7e2be2495411e61d209dd6024","node_id":"C_kwDOOafN99oAKDI4MjY1MzZkNmE0ZWIxZDdlMmJlMjQ5NTQxMWU2MWQyMDlkZDYwMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/customgpt-ai/commit/53abc6407d293a1976d4f258e981d5f9cd4c6a59","sha":"53abc6407d293a1976d4f258e981d5f9cd4c6a59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/customgpt-ai/commits/53abc6407d293a1976d4f258e981d5f9cd4c6a59"}],"sha":"2826536d6a4eb1d7e2be2495411e61d209dd6024","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/customgpt-ai/commits/2826536d6a4eb1d7e2be2495411e61d209dd6024"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/customgpt-ai/commits/53abc6407d293a1976d4f258e981d5f9cd4c6a59/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T19:12:33Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T19:12:33Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"refactor: purge pages by streaming batch instead of collect-all-then-delete\n\nReplace the two-phase approach (fetchAllPageIds → deleteAllPages) with a\nstreaming loop that always fetches the first result page, deletes those IDs\nconcurrently, then re-queries until the first page is empty.\n\nAlways re-querying from page 1 (instead of following next_page_url) prevents\noffset-pagination drift: after deleting items from page 1, items that were on\npage 2 shift into page 1, so following next_page_url would silently skip them.\n\nfetchAllPageIds and extractNextPageUrl are removed; fetchOnePage replaces them.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"3767770fcf62e30cfb3f7c31c9674c5b085bd233","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/customgpt-ai/git/trees/3767770fcf62e30cfb3f7c31c9674c5b085bd233"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/customgpt-ai/git/commits/53abc6407d293a1976d4f258e981d5f9cd4c6a59","verification":{"payload":"tree 3767770fcf62e30cfb3f7c31c9674c5b085bd233\nparent 5691da0a3a46d6770f1ff123dd38af8ade8cad5f\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778699553 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778699553 +0200\n\nrefactor: purge pages by streaming batch instead of collect-all-then-delete\n\nReplace the two-phase approach (fetchAllPageIds → deleteAllPages) with a\nstreaming loop that always fetches the first result page, deletes those IDs\nconcurrently, then re-queries until the first page is empty.\n\nAlways re-querying from page 1 (instead of following next_page_url) prevents\noffset-pagination drift: after deleting items from page 1, items that were on\npage 2 shift into page 1, so following next_page_url would silently skip them.\n\nfetchAllPageIds and extractNextPageUrl are removed; fetchOnePage replaces them.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.